  {
   "i": 1130,
   "src": "61d382b0d43a",
   "t": "What's wrong?\nYou can't win just by defending."
  },
  {
   "i": 1198,
   "src": "b92be2ec490e",
   "t": "\"Your attacks can't reach my body.\"\nThat's what you said, right?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1209,
   "src": "edee419b7467",
   "t": "You blocked every attack\nwith that black aura, but..."
  },
  {
   "i": 1214,
   "src": "e023bba5b141",
   "t": "I bet you never imagined\nyour own attack getting blocked."
  },
  {
   "i": 1241,
   "src": "28ebb89208de",
   "t": "So what?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1274,
   "src": "1e8a61811d59",
   "t": "Go on, use it.\nYour real {{medaforce}}!"
  },
  {
   "i": 1353,
   "src": "bf478669310e",
   "t": "Don't underestimate my power,\nyou mere human!"
  },
  {
   "i": 1586,
   "src": "e0e7a9c631fc",
   "t": "Ngh, this much power...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 1630,
   "src": "14d337d8c62e",
   "t": "Aaaaahh...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 1690,
   "src": "0b06aec44d38",
   "t": "Ah!\n{{phantom_thief_jill}}'s mask!"
  },
  {
   "i": 1720,
   "src": "fe46cca64783",
   "t": "...Huh?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1747,
   "src": "b700b5f68384",
   "t": "{{phantom_thief_jill}} is really Marie?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 1774,
   "src": "ca3b84315756",
   "t": "...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 1916,
   "src": "d734851106a5",
   "t": "Still standing...?\nYou're in my way!"
  },
  {
   "i": 1946,
   "src": "b09a6042816f",
   "t": "Now even this will work...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 2000,
   "src": "1337806c4951",
   "t": "Don't get smart!"
  },
  {
   "i": 2125,
   "src": "39045524d4f6",
